Third-party material in Opal Compat
==================================

Opal Compat is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 only, in LICENSE
(with the GNU General Public License version 3 it refers to, in COPYING).

Files that reproduce or adapt material of another project are listed here, with that project's
terms. Every such file also names its origin in its header.

Vitrail, https://github.com/avpbynf/Vitrail-Shaders
Copyright the Vitrail contributors
GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
Vitrail's own NOTICE, which lists the material Vitrail adapted from Iris, is kept in
NOTICE-vitrail and applies to every file taken from Vitrail.

Iris, https://github.com/IrisShaders/Iris (branch 1.21.1)
Copyright the Iris contributors
GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
Besides what reaches this project through Vitrail, these follow Iris's behaviour and name what they
follow in their headers; none of them copies its code:
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/Families.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/HandPass.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/ShadowFeatures.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/ShadowMaps.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/DrawIds.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/TextureImages.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/mixin/ItemInHandRendererMixin.java
  src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/render/PassBuffers.java

VulkanMod Reforged, https://github.com/TrulyRin/VulkanMod-Reforged
GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
Not redistributed; a runtime dependency only. The mixins in dev.opalcompat.mixin reach into its classes,
and render/MeshDraw.java draws with its index buffers using the counts its Drawer uses.

Distant Horizons, https://gitlab.com/distant-horizons-team/distant-horizons (3.3.3)
GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
Not redistributed; compiled against. src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/dh implements its renderer interfaces and
copies none of its code. Its vertex layout and quad order are followed in LodBuffer and PackPipeline.

Opal Shaders 1.0.0-alpha.8
Its metadata gives the license as "UNDECIDED". Not redistributed; nothing of it is copied. src/stubs names the few
members this mod calls, so that it compiles without the jar, and is left out of the built jar.

Vectors 1.5.3
Copyright 2026 Vector contributors
MIT License. Not redistributed. src/stubs names the members this mod calls and is left out of the built jar. The
ranges of the sliders in src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/compat/VectorsPages.java are the ones its own settings screen gives them.

Flywheel, https://github.com/Engine-Room/Flywheel
MIT License
Not redistributed. src/main/java/dev/opalcompat/compat/mixin/FlywheelShaderPackMixin.java answers its question whether a
shader pack is in use.
